{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Award medal to recognise Armed Forces personnel who served on Op Rescript",
        "additional_details": "Personnel were required to adapt to unfamiliar working environments, operate under exceptional restrictions and make personal sacrifices while continuing to fulfil their military duties.We believe their commitment, professionalism and contribution to the country deserve formal recognition. Those who were called upon to serve their country during a national emergency should not have their contribution overlooked. We ask the Government to give this matter the consideration it deserves.",
        "background": "We call on the UK Government and MOD to formally recognise Armed Forces personnel who deployed in support of Op Rescript during the COVID-19 pandemic through appropriate medallic recognition.",
